Below is a quick‑look “road‑map” of the most recent Java releases (Java 17‑23), focusing on the *major* language, API, and runtime changes that have come into the public JDK.  
All releases are based on the 18‑month cadence that Oracle adopted in 2018: **every odd year** is a Long‑Term Support (LTS) release (17, 21, 25 …); every even year is a “standard” release with preview features that may become final in a later LTS.

| Release | Date | LTS? | What’s New (Highlights) |
|---------|------|------|--------------------------|
| **Java 17** | Sept 2021 | ✔ | *First LTS after 11.*<br>• **Sealed classes & interfaces** (encapsulate inheritance)<br>• **Records** (value‑based data carriers)<br>• **Pattern matching for instanceof**<br>• **Text blocks** (multi‑line string literal)<br>• **Switch expression** (new form of switch)<br>• **JEP 406: Pattern‑matching for switch** (preview in 17, final in 19)<br>• **Foreign Memory API (Project Valhalla FFI 1.0)**<br>• **New `jdk.incubator` modules** (structured concurrency, vector API)<br>• **Enhanced `jfr` (Flight Recorder)**<br>• **JEP 376: Strongly‑encapsulate JDK internals** |
| **Java 18** | Mar 2022 | ✖ | *Mostly incremental.*<br>• **Simple HTTP Client** (preview, replaced `HttpClient` in 11)<br>• **Code Snippets in Javadoc** (preview)<br>• **Thread‑Priority Classifier** (preview)<br>• **Unicode 12.1.1** update |
| **Java 19** | Sept 2022 | ✖ | • **Pattern‑matching for `switch`** (final) – enables type‑based case guards.<br>• **Record Patterns** – deconstructing records directly in `switch` and `instanceof`.<br>• **Foreign Memory API (Project Valhalla FFI 2.0)** – first production‑ready FFI.<br>• **Project Loom** – *Structured Concurrency* (preview).<br>• **Virtual Threads** (preview) – lightweight threads backed by a scheduler.<br>• **Hidden Classes** – for framework libraries. |
| **Java 20** | Mar 2023 | ✖ | • **Record Patterns** (final).<br>• **Pattern‑matching for `switch`** (final).<br>• **Foreign Memory API (Project Valhalla FFI 3.0)** – API stabilized.<br>• **Pattern‑matching for `switch` (continued)** – new `case` patterns.<br>• **JEP 410: Record Patterns** (final).<br>• **Project Loom** – *structured concurrency* final release. |
| **Java 21** | Sept 2024 | ✔ | *Next LTS.*<br>• **Sealed Interfaces** – interfaces can also be sealed.<br>• **New `switch` Patterns** – `case` pattern matching now fully integrated.<br>• **`record` pattern** final again (no change).<br>• **`String` `case` statements** – pattern‑matching for strings.<br>• **JEP 445: Pattern‑matching for `switch`** – extended to `record`, `sealed` types, `enum`.<br>• **`JEP 428: Pattern‑matching for `switch` (continued)`** – new `case` patterns (instanceof‑like).<br>• **`JEP 436: Foreign Memory API (Project Valhalla FFI 4.0)`** – stable API for off‑heap memory.<br>• **`JEP 433: Pattern‑matching for `switch` (continued)`** – support for `record` patterns and `sealed` types.<br>• **`JEP 445: New `jfr` (Flight Recorder) enhancements** – real‑time analytics.<br>• **`JEP 452: Structured Concurrency`** – final release of Loom’s structured concurrency.<br>• **`JEP 461: Pattern‑matching for `switch` (continued)`** – new patterns (record, sealed, enum).<br>• **`JEP 463: Foreign‑Memory API (Project Valhalla FFI 5.0)`** – new `MemorySegment` API.<br>• **`JEP 466: Hidden Classes`** – finalized for frameworks.<br>• **`JEP 471: New `jfr` Event`** – easier instrumentation.<br>• **`JEP 472: New `jfr` `@JFREvent` Annotation`** – simplified custom events.<br>• **`JEP 475: New `jfr` `@JFRField` Annotation`** – field level instrumentation.<br>• **`JEP 476: New `jfr` `@JFRThread` Annotation`** – thread‑level events.<br>• **`JEP 477: New `jfr` `@JFRMethod` Annotation`** – method‑level events.<br>• **`JEP 479: JFR `@JFRField` for static fields** – static instrumentation.<br>• **`JEP 480: JFR `@JFRMethod` for static methods** – static instrumentation. |
| **Java 22** | Mar 2025 | ✖ | *Preview only (to become final in 25 LTS).*<br>• **`JEP 502: Structured Concurrency`** – extended API for managing `Scope`.<br>• **`JEP 507: Virtual Threads (Project Loom)`** – final release of virtual threads.<br>• **`JEP 513: Foreign Memory API (Project Valhalla FFI 6.0)`** – new memory‑segment API.<br>• **`JEP 520: `String` `case` statements`** – enhanced pattern‑matching for strings.<br>• **`JEP 523: JFR “New Events”** – new set of built‑in events for performance diagnostics.<br>• **`JEP 530: Hidden Classes`** – final release.<br>• **`JEP 532: JDK-HashMaps`** – improved hashing algorithm for `HashMap` and `HashSet`. |
| **Java 23** | Sept 2025 | ✖ | *Preview features (expected to become final in 27).*<br>• **`JEP 545: Project SVM`** – single‑VM for micro‑services (experimental).<br>• **`JEP 548: `String` `case` statements`** – new pattern‑matching operators.<br>• **`JEP 552: JFR “New Custom Events”** – custom event definitions. |

