## How to Keep Up‑to‑Date

| Tool / Service | What it gives you |
|----------------|-------------------|
| **JDK‑Release notes** (https://openjdk.java.net/projects/jdk/21/) | Full JEP list, changelog, API docs |
| **`java --release`** | Compile against older releases |
| **OpenJDK GitHub** (https://github.com/openjdk) | Inspect branches, pull requests, JEP proposals |
| **OpenJDK “JEP” wiki** (https://openjdk.java.net/projects/jdk/21/docs/) | Full specification of each feature |
| **Java Magazine / Java World** | Summaries of new features, usage patterns |

