## Quick Code Examples

### 1. Sealed Classes (Java 17)

```java
public sealed interface Shape permits Circle, Square { … }

public final class Circle implements Shape { … }
public final class Square implements Shape { … }
```

### 2. Pattern‑Matching for `switch` (Java 21)

```java
String result = switch (obj) {
  case Circle c   -> "Circle with radius " + c.radius();
  case Square s   -> "Square with side " + s.side();
  case null       -> "No shape";
  default         -> "Unknown shape";
};
```

### 3. Virtual Threads (Java 21)

```java
ExecutorService pool = Executors.newVirtualThreadPerTaskExecutor();
pool.submit(() -> {
    // long‑running I/O, e.g. DB call
});
```

### 4. Foreign Memory API (Java 21)

```java
MemorySegment seg = MemorySegment.ofArray(new byte[]{1,2,3,4});
byte b = seg.get(ValueLayout.JAVA_BYTE, 0);
```

